<title>USA: OMAHA HOGS STEADY - USDA.</title>
<headline>OMAHA HOGS STEADY - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were uneven, steady. Top $55.75 per cwt. - USDA US 1-3    220-270 lbs mostly 55.75</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-280 lbs    54.50-55.25</p>
<p>Sows: 25 percent. Not esbablished.</p>
</text>
